/// Bitcoin treasury fact table combining two analytical grains: current government-entity snapshots and dated El Salvador treasury checkpoints. Snapshot and historical records must be separated using Record_Type. Entity_Name and Government_Level distinguish national, state, and municipal holdings; Snapshot dates are intentionally blank because the source provides no as-of date.
